    "notes": "Primary discriminator is parent process path — Fawkes agent in user-writable directories (AppData, Temp) is strongly anomalous vs. legitimate invocations from svchost.exe or CcmExec.exe running as SYSTEM. The combination of net user + net localgroup + wmic useraccount in rapid succession from the same parent PID is a reliable Fawkes net-enum signature. Filter on SYSTEM context + trusted parent paths covers the bulk of FP scenarios."
